# Eleven Years | INT | Hospital Chapel, Rehearsal | DAY | tom, ned_f, lady_h | Sing | Boys in brown. A solo given to the one with the ear. A lady with a glass asks his name. {ned_f} whispers that his mother was probably a duchess | {tom} is noticed | 5 | crowd=80
