# The Price | INT | Clerk's Office | DAY | sarah, mr_collin | Hear the sum | Eleven years' keep. He names it. Then, against the rules, how few have ever paid, and what the boy has been offered. She goes away without a word | She must choose for him | 6 | props=billet book
# The Price | INT | Admission Room | DAY | sarah, tom, mr_collin, ned_f | Match it | A purse on the table. A packet unsealed. Two halves of a bird laid edge to edge. The boy is furious. At the door {ned_f} says: go on, then | The token matches | 7 | props=ribbon halves+purse
